# DustOutput regression test
#
# Tests Phase 16: dust plotfile on native dust grid and CSV diagnostics.
#
# Plotfile uses VisMF::Write + WriteGenericPlotfileHeader on the native
# 2D dust BoxArray and Geometry (not part of ERF AMR hierarchy).
# Pattern: ERF_FirePlotfile.cpp in Source/Fire/:
#   https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/ERF-Fire/Source/Fire/ERF_FirePlotfile.cpp
#
# ERF writes at intervals (dust_plot_int) and at the final step even if
# final step is not a multiple of dust_plot_int. Final-step guard:
#   is_final=true and nstep > m_last_dust_plot_step
# Pattern matches WriteAtFinalTime in Source/ERF.cpp.
#
# max_step = 7, dust_plot_int = 3.
# Plotfiles at: 0 (InitData_post), 3, 6, 7 (final, not multiple of 3).
#
# Atmospheric configuration: Moeng-Sullivan neutral ABL.
# Reference: Exec/CanonicalTests/ABL/MRF_Enhancements/canonical/neutral_abl
# MRF u* ~ 0.56 m/s with 15 m/s geostrophic wind.
#
# Expected results:
#   (1) plt_dust_00000/, plt_dust_00003/, plt_dust_00006/ created at
#       steps 0, 3, 6 (multiples of dust_plot_int=3).
#   (2) plt_dust_00007/ created at final step 7 (not multiple of 3).
#   (3) Each plotfile directory contains: Header, Level_0/Cell*,
#       DustMetadata.json.
#   (4) Header is standard AMReX format with 8 variable names:
#       dust_emission_flux, dust_ustar_in, dust_ustar_t,
#       dust_deposition_rate, dust_conc_sfc, dust_surf_moist,
#       dust_suppression, dust_retreat_flag.
#   (5) DustMetadata.json contains format_version, time, step,
#       grid_ratio=1, n_variables=8.
#   (6) dust_diag.dat created with header + 8 rows (steps 0-7).
#   (7) dust_diag.dat emission_total_kg_s > 0 after step 1.
#   (8) dust_diag.dat deposition_total_kg_m2 increases monotonically.
#   (9) [DUST DEBUG] Phase 16 plotfile written at steps 0, 3, 6, 7.
#  (10) Setting dust_plot_int = -1: no plotfile directories created,
#       dust_diag.dat still written every step.
#  (11) Run exits with code 0.
#
# References:
#   AMReX plotfile format:
#     https://amrex-codes.github.io/amrex/docs_html/IO.html
#   ERF_FirePlotfile.cpp pattern (VisMF + WriteGenericPlotfileHeader):
#     https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/ERF-Fire/Source/Fire/ERF_FirePlotfile.cpp
#   ERF_FireStatsOutput.H pattern (CSV append):
#     https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/ERF-Fire/Source/Fire/ERF_FireStatsOutput.H
#   Ginoux et al. (2001). J. Geophys. Res., 106, 20255.
#     https://doi.org/10.1029/2000JD901323
#   Marticorena & Bergametti (1995). J. Geophys. Res., 100, 16415.
#     https://doi.org/10.1029/95JD00690

